    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kũgaya Bũrũri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Hĩndĩ ĩrĩa mũkaagaya bũrũri ũtuĩke magai-rĩ, nĩmũkarutĩra Jehova gĩcigo kĩa bũrũri ũcio gĩtuĩke rũgongo rwamũre, gĩkorwo na mĩkono 25,000kũraiha, na mĩkono 20,000kwarama; gĩcigo kĩu gĩothe gĩgaatuĩka gĩtheru.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gĩcigo-inĩ kĩu, nĩhakagaywo gĩcigo kĩa mĩena ĩna ĩigananĩte, gĩkorwo kĩrĩ na mĩkono 500o mwena, hatuĩke handũ-harĩa-haamũre, hacooke hathiũrũrũkĩrio nĩ njĩra ya mĩkono mĩrongo ĩtano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rũgongo-inĩ rũu rwamũre, nĩmũgathima gĩcunjĩ kĩa ũraihu wa mĩkono 25,000, na wariĩ wa mĩkono 10,000. Gĩcigo-inĩ kĩu nĩho hagaakwo handũ-harĩa-haamũre, na nĩho Handũ-harĩa-Hatheru-Mũno.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Handũ hau hagaatuĩka haamũre thĩinĩ wa bũrũri nĩ ũndũ wa athĩnjĩri-Ngai, arĩa matungataga handũ-harĩa-haamũre, arĩa marĩĩkuhagĩrĩria ho nĩguo matungatagĩre Jehova. No ho hagaatuĩka ha nyũmba ciao o na hatuĩke harĩa hatheru ha handũ-harĩa-haamũre.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gĩcigo kĩa mũigana wa ũraihu wa mĩkono 25,000, na wariĩ wa 10,000 gĩgaatuĩka kĩa Alawii, arĩa matungataga thĩinĩ wa hekarũ, gĩtuĩke igai rĩao rĩa gwakwo matũũra ma gũtũũrwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Nĩmũkagaya gĩcigo gĩakwo itũũra inene, gĩcigo kĩa wariĩ wa mĩkono 5,000,na ũraihu wa mĩkono 25,000, kĩhakane na gĩcigo kĩrĩa kĩamũre; gĩcigo kĩu gĩgaatuĩka kĩa andũ a nyũmba yothe ya Isiraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Gĩthaka kĩrĩa gĩgaatuĩka kĩa mũnene ũcio gĩkaahakana mbarĩ cierĩ na rũgongo rũrĩa rwamũrĩirwo Jehova, hamwe na gĩthaka gĩa itũũra rĩrĩa inene. Kuuma mwena wa ithũĩro gĩgaatambũrũka kĩrorete mwena wa ithũĩro, na kuuma mwena wa irathĩro gĩtambũrũke kĩrorete mwena wa irathĩro, naguo ũraihu wakĩo ũgaakĩĩgama kuuma mũhaka wa ithũĩro nginya wa irathĩro, gĩtwaranĩte na mĩhaka ya magai ma Benjamini na Juda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gĩthaka kĩu nĩkĩo gĩgaatuĩka igai rĩake thĩinĩ wa bũrũri wa Isiraeli. Nao anene acio akwa matigacooka kũhinyĩrĩria andũ akwa, no nĩmagetĩkĩria andũ a nyũmba ya Isiraeli megwatĩre bũrũri ũcio kũringana na mĩhĩrĩga yao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Mwathani Jehova ekuuga ũũ: Inyuĩ anene aya a Isiraeli, ũguo mwĩkĩte nĩ mũiganu! Eheriai maũndũ ma ũhinya na ma kũhinyanĩrĩria, mwĩkage ũndũ ũrĩa ũrĩ wa kĩhooto na wagĩrĩire. Tigai gũtunyaga andũ akwa indo, ũguo nĩguo Mwathani Jehova ekuuga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "No nginya mũhũthagĩre ithimo iria iringaine wega, na mũhũthagĩre eba ĩrĩa ĩringaine wega, o na bathi ĩrĩa ĩringaine wega.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eba na bathi ikorwo irĩ kĩgeri kĩmwe kĩiganaine, bathi ĩmwe ĩiganagĩre gĩcunjĩ gĩa ikũmi kĩa homeri o ĩmwe, o nayo eba ĩmwe ĩiganagĩre gĩcunjĩ gĩa ikũmi kĩa homeri o ĩmwe; homeri ĩmwe ituĩke nĩyo kĩgeri kĩrĩa gĩĩtĩkĩrĩku gĩa gũcithima cierĩ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cekeri ĩmwe ĩrĩkoragwo ĩrĩ ya gera mĩrongo ĩĩrĩ. Cekeri mĩrongo ĩĩrĩ, kuonganĩrĩria na cekeri ingĩ mĩrongo ĩĩrĩ na ithano, kuonganĩrĩria na ingĩ ikũmi na ithano, nĩ ũndũ ũmwe na mina ĩmwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Maruta na Mĩthenya ĩrĩa Mĩamũre",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Gĩkĩ nĩkĩo kĩheo kĩa mwanya kĩrĩa mũrĩĩrutaga: Nakĩo nĩ gĩcunjĩ gĩa ithathatũ kĩa eba ĩmwekuuma harĩ o homeri ĩmweya ngano, na gĩcunjĩ gĩa ithathatũ kĩa eba ĩmwe kuuma harĩ o homeri ĩmwe ya cairi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gĩcunjĩ kĩrĩa gĩtue kĩa maguta, mathimĩtwo na gĩthimi kĩa bathi, nĩ gĩcunjĩ gĩa ikũmi kĩa bathikuuma harĩ o kori ĩmwe(nayo kori ĩmwe ĩrĩ na bathiikũmi kana homeri ĩmwe, nĩgũkorwo bathi ikũmi nĩcio homeri ĩmwe).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ningĩ ngʼondu ĩmwe nĩĩkarutwo kuuma harĩ o rũũru rwa ngʼondu magana meerĩ kuuma ũrĩithio-inĩ ũrĩa mwega ũrĩ maaĩ kũu bũrũri wa Isiraeli. Icio nĩcio igaatuĩka cia maruta ma mũtu, na maruta ma njino, o na cia maruta ma ngwatanĩro, nĩguo andũ mahorohagĩrio nacio, ũguo nĩguo Mwathani Jehova ekuuga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Andũ othe a bũrũri nĩmakanyiitanĩra ũhoro-inĩ ũcio wa kũruta iheo cia mwanya cia kũhũthĩrwo nĩ mũnene thĩinĩ wa bũrũri wa Isiraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mũnene ũcio nĩwe ũkaarutaga maruta ma njino, na maruta ma mũtu, na maruta ma kũnyuuo ciathĩ-inĩ, na Tũrũgamo twa Mweri, na Thabatũ, o na ciathĩ-inĩ ciothe iria njathane cia andũ a nyũmba ya Isiraeli. Nĩakaruta maruta ma mehia, na maruta ma mũtu, na maruta ma njino, na maruta ma ngwatanĩro ma kũhoroheria andũ a nyũmba ya Isiraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Mwathani Jehova ekuuga ũũ: Mweri wa mbere, o mũthenya wa mbere wa mweri ũcio, nĩmũkaruta gategwa gatarĩ na kaũũgũ nĩguo mũtherie handũ-harĩa-haamũre.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai nĩakooya thakame ĩmwe ya maruta ma mehia amĩhake itingĩ-inĩ cia mĩrango ya hekarũ, na amĩhake koine ciothe inya cia metha ya kĩgongona, o na amĩhake itingĩ-inĩ cia itoonyero rĩa nja ya na thĩinĩ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ũguo noguo mũgeeka mũthenya wa mũgwanja wa mweri ũcio nĩ ũndũ wa mũndũ o wothe ũngĩĩhia atekwenda kana ehie nĩ ũndũ wa kũrigwo; ũguo nĩguo mũkaahoroheria hekarũ ĩyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Mweri wa mbere, mũthenya wa ikũmi na ĩna wa mweri o ũcio nĩguo mũrĩgĩaga na gĩathĩ kĩa Bathaka, ihinda rĩa mĩthenya mũgwanja, ihinda rĩrĩa mũrĩrĩĩaga mĩgate ĩtarĩ mĩĩkĩre ndawa ya kũimbia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mũthenya ũcio-rĩ, mũnene akaaruta ndegwa irĩ iruta rĩa mehia nĩ ũndũ wake mwene, o na nĩ ũndũ wa andũ othe a bũrũri ũcio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O mũthenya, ihinda rĩa mĩthenya ĩyo mũgwanja ya Gĩathĩ kĩu, mũnene ũcio nĩakaruta ndegwa mũgwanja, na ndũrũme mũgwanja itarĩ na kaũũgũ, cia kũrutĩra Jehova maruta ma njino, na arute thenge cia iruta rĩa mehia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ningĩ arute mũtu wa eba ĩmweũtuĩke iruta rĩa mũtu harĩ o ndegwa, na eba ĩmwe harĩ o ndũrũme, na hini ĩmweya maguta harĩ eba ĩmwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
